- Her meadow restoration work influenced UK agricultural policy on habitat corridors.

The student wants to emphasize the range of Rothschild''s contributions across different fields. Which choice most effectively uses relevant information from the notes to accomplish this goal?', E'While researching a topic, a student has taken the following notes:

- Entomologist Miriam Rothschild published over 350 scientific papers during her career.
