- Resilin can release stored energy almost instantaneously, propelling fleas up to 150 times their body length.
- Rothschild was also a prominent conservationist who converted her family estate into wildflower meadows.
- Her meadow restoration work influenced UK agricultural policy on habitat corridors.', $lyceon_json$[{"key":"A","text":"Miriam Rothschild discovered that fleas store energy in a pad of resilin protein, which can release that energy almost instantaneously and propel fleas up to 150 times their own body length."},{"key":"B","text":"In addition to publishing over 350 scientific papers and discovering the resilin-based mechanism behind flea jumping, Miriam Rothschild championed wildflower conservation, converting her estate into meadows that shaped UK habitat policy."},{"key":"C","text":"As a conservationist, Miriam Rothschild transformed her family estate into wildflower meadows, and this restoration work went on to influence UK agricultural policy regarding habitat corridors."},{"key":"D","text":"Miriam Rothschild was an entomologist who published over 350 scientific papers during her distinguished career in biological research."}]$lyceon_json$::jsonb, 'B', NULL, E'The goal is to emphasize the range of Rothschild''s contributions across different fields. The answer that mentions both her entomological discovery of the resilin mechanism and her conservation work with wildflower meadows and policy influence is the only option that spans both fields, thereby demonstrating range. The option about resilin and flea jumping focuses exclusively on her entomological work, omitting conservation entirely. The option about wildflower meadows and habitat policy addresses only her conservation contributions without mentioning her scientific research. The option noting her 350 papers provides only a quantitative summary of her publication output without specifying any particular field or achievement.', $lyceon_json${"A":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"partial_reasoning"},"B":{"role":"correct","error_taxonomy":null},"C":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"partial_reasoning"},"D":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"partial_reasoning"}}$lyceon_json$::jsonb, NULL, 'draft',